[561.524189, "o", "\u001b[37m-matrix solves\u001b[0m"]
[561.55258, "o", "\u001b[37m for\u001b[0m"]
[561.574326, "o", "\u001b[37m those\u001b[0m"]
[561.598063, "o", "\u001b[37m 3 rows\u001b[0m"]
[561.65326, "o", "\u001b[37m.\u001b[0m"]
[561.680859, "o", "\r\n\r\n"]
[561.777106, "o", "\u001b[34m##\u001b[0m\u001b[37m \u001b[0m\u001b[34mThe fix (solver settings only — no physics touched)\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[561.777652, "o", "\u001b[37m```\u001b[0m"]
[561.799553, "o", "\u001b[37mxml\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[37m<\u001b[0m\u001b[31moption\u001b[0m"]
[561.831915, "o", "\u001b[37m solver=\"P\u001b[0m"]
[561.857265, "o", "\u001b[37mGS\" jac\u001b[0m"]
[561.911384, "o", "\u001b[37mobian=\"dense\"\u001b[0m"]
[561.971059, "o", "\u001b[37m tolerance=\"1e-12\u001b[0m"]
[561.990157, "o", "\u001b[37m\" iterations=\"100\"/>\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[565.379305, "o", "\u001b[37m```\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[37m* `solver=\"PGS\"` — projected Gauss-Seidel converges for this tiny constraint set in ≤ 34 iterations (cost ~3 µs instead of 150 µs).\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[37m* `tolerance=\"1e-12\"` — PGS is first-order; at the default 1e-8 it stops slightly short (final-state error ~1e-6). Tightening it makes the tuned model *more* converged than the reference's Newton tolerance, dropping the deviation to ~1e-8 at zero measurable cost.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[37m* `iterations=\"100\"` — generous cap (observed max 34, so runtime is never iteration-bound).\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[37m* `jacobian=\"dense\"` — explicit; the auto-selected sparse path is actually slower here (nv=118), saving another ~9 µs/step.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[37m## Verification\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[37m* Bodies, joints, geoms, masses/inertias, damping, plugin config, timestep (0.002), integrator (Euler) are **byte-identical** to `model_ref.xml` (checked field-by-field programmatically; the XML diff is only a comment block plus the `<option>` line). `model_ref.xml` untouched.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[37m* `python3 eval.py` "]
[565.379387, "o", "(repeated 8×): state diff `0.0000`, speedup **2.17–2.21×**, time pctg **0.45–0.46**.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[37m* Extra robustness sweep over 60 random seeds: max deviation **6.9e-8**, mean 7.7e-9, all states finite, 60/60 pass `atol=1e-5`.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[565.428049, "o", "\u001b[?2004hroot@c00daea9f3a7:/app# "]
[580.886807, "i", "\u0004"]
[580.887377, "o", "\u001b[?2004l\r\r\nexit\r\n"]
